OL,3,GNEWSAShoppers evacuated after vehicle
OL,4,Afire at Tesco car park in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FShoppers and staff have been evacuated
OL,7,Fafter a vehicle blaze in a car park at
OL,8,Fa supermarket in Glasgow.
OL,10,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,F(SFRS) said two fire engines were sent
OL,12,Fto the Tesco Extra store on Maryhill
OL,13,FRoad at about 16:20.
OL,15,FFootage shared on social media showed a
OL,16,Fblack car engulfed in flames in the
OL,17,Fcorner of the covered parking area,
OL,18,Fbeneath the shop floor.
OL,20,FLarge clouds of black smoke were seen
OL,21,Ffilling the car park and spilling out
OL,22,Fonto Maryhill Road.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
